# AI Integration Rules

## OpenAI Integration
- Always handle rate limits and timeouts gracefully
- Implement exponential backoff for API failures
- Use Jinja2 templates for maintainable AI prompts
- Provide meaningful error messages for AI failures

## Vector Databases
- Abstract vector databases behind service layer for swappable backends
- Log vector database operations for debugging and performance tuning
- Monitor vector database memory consumption
- Cache expensive operations like vector embeddings
